### 获取商品接口使用的登录凭证
# @name productLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin","password":"12345678"}

###

### 停用 SKU
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/1/skus/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"inactive"}

### 启用 SKU
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/1/skus/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"active"}
